# Claude Code's scratch space, INCLUDING its git worktrees (.claude/worktrees/<name>
# is a live checkout with its own .git). Never committable: an embedded repository
# would go in as a gitlink nobody can clone, and a broad `git add -A` here would try
# (Codex 2026-07-26).
.claude/
